  <!-- EN: dark apocalypse -->
  <WNA_WhelingnortherApocalypse.label>黑暗天启</WNA_WhelingnortherApocalypse.label>
  <!-- EN: "When early ancestors of humanity rose from the humble, it was their effort and sacrifices that led to the prosperity of today world; when our predecessors rose from the insignificance, it was their effort and sacrifices that led to we Whelingnorther Alliance. Any great work requires sacrifices to forge, without great destruction can there be no great rebirth, without great devotions will we not achieve eternity salvation and immortality. We descendants shall follow the path led by those who came before us; we will see our duty and accept our manifest destiny; we shall alter and determine the past, the present and the future. All any existance shall bath in the glory of Whelignorther, they need not understand, only shall they obey." -->
  <WNA_WhelingnortherApocalypse.description>“昔日人类先民起于微末之中，正是他们用奋力与牺牲换来了今日世界的繁荣；昔日我等前人崛起草芥之中，正是他们的奋力与牺牲成就了今日的威灵诺德联合会。一切伟大之作都需以牺牲铸就，没有伟大的毁灭便没有伟大的新生，没有伟大的奉献便无从寻求永恒自在不朽。我等后人当遵行前人引领的道路，我等明晰我等将负的重负，欣然接受我等的昭昭天命，我等将决定过往、当下与未来。一切存在之物都将沐浴威灵诺德的荣光，它们无需理解，它们必将服从。”</WNA_WhelingnortherApocalypse.description>
  
  <!-- EN: Whelingnorther Military -->
  <WNA_WNAMilitary.label>威灵军部</WNA_WNAMilitary.label>
  <!-- EN: Composed of three major command posts and led by a Chief Administrative Commander, the Whelingnorther Military serves as physical body in reality of Whelingnorther Alliance, driving forward the great career of WNA with violence, sacrifices and countless destructions. -->
  <WNA_WNAMilitary.description>由三大司令部组成，由一位三军事务总长统率，威灵军部作为威灵诺德联合会在现实世界中的实体发挥着作用，以暴力、牺牲与数不清的毁灭推进着威灵会的伟业。</WNA_WNAMilitary.description>
  <!-- EN: You now have reached the level that never any person had reached. Stepping forward is almost impossible. \n\nOne wise choice is to find a techprof subpersona core, with its power you can take a glance at what Whelingnorther Alliance truly masters. The other choice is to jusi ask Whelingnorther Alliance about it. \n\nAsking is easy, but <color=#FF0000>some price will be paid</color>. -->
  <WNA_WNAMilitary.discoveredLetterText>你现在已经达到了前无古人的高度。想要再前进一步已经几乎不再可能。\n\n一个最明智的选择是去找一个科技核心，凭借它的力量，你可以一窥威灵诺德联合会真正掌握的技艺。另一个选择则是直接去询问威灵诺德联合会。\n\n问问题很简单，但&lt;color=#FF0000>某些代价终将被付出&lt;/color>。</WNA_WNAMilitary.discoveredLetterText>
  <!-- EN: Path ahead blocked -->
  <WNA_WNAMilitary.discoveredLetterTitle>道路尽头</WNA_WNAMilitary.discoveredLetterTitle>
  
